  "bio": "Dani Blalock is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Charlotte, NC, specializing in illustrative, newschool, and neotraditional styles. Renowned for their exceptional talent, Dani's work is characterized by a vivid blend of colors and intricate designs, seamlessly merging classic techniques with modern flair. Clients seeking bold and unique tattoos will find Dani's portfolio to be a testament to their top-tier artistic capability.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nTattoo Artist⚡️ Charlotte NC\nNo DMs-Books Open\nInquiries: Ldmace@gmail.com \nPersonal: @danimace",
